@startuml
title C16 export, import, and new-tab safety
' Traces: OMCT-C16-L2-04.03, OMCT-C16-L2-04.04, OMCT-C16-L2-04.05, OMCT-C16-L2-04.06, OMCT-C16-L2-04.07
actor Operator
participant "CSVExporter" as CsvExporter
participant "DomainObjectLoader" as Loader
participant "OpenInNewTabAction" as NewTabAction
participant "OpenImageInNewTabAction" as ImageNewTabAction
participant "ImageExporter" as ImageExporter
participant "Browser" as Browser

Operator -> CsvExporter: export telemetry table row
activate CsvExporter
CsvExporter -> CsvExporter: neutralize formula-triggering cell values
CsvExporter --> Operator: CSV export payload
deactivate CsvExporter

Operator -> Loader: load or import domain object JSON
activate Loader
Loader -> Loader: drop __proto__ payload properties
Loader --> Operator: domain object without polluted prototype properties
deactivate Loader

Operator -> NewTabAction: open object in new tab
activate NewTabAction
NewTabAction -> Browser: open with opener isolation options
activate Browser
Browser --> NewTabAction: tab opened
deactivate Browser
NewTabAction --> Operator: isolated tab opened
deactivate NewTabAction

Operator -> ImageNewTabAction: open image in new tab
activate ImageNewTabAction
ImageNewTabAction -> ImageNewTabAction: evaluate image URL allow list
alt URL allowed
  ImageNewTabAction -> Browser: open image with opener isolation options
  activate Browser
  Browser --> ImageNewTabAction: tab opened
  deactivate Browser
  ImageNewTabAction --> Operator: image tab opened
else URL blocked
  ImageNewTabAction --> Operator: navigation blocked
end
deactivate ImageNewTabAction

Operator -> ImageExporter: export image filename
activate ImageExporter
ImageExporter -> ImageExporter: remove unsupported characters and trim periods
ImageExporter --> Operator: sanitized filename
deactivate ImageExporter
@enduml
